  "verified": [
    "2026-09-06: fan rows chain rear to front with the SL-Infinity template rotated pi on both rows",
    "2026-09-06: GPU bar LED 0 at the rear; Prism S GPU strimer rotated 180 from the naive placement",
    "2026-09-06: TL LCD fan rings wind counter-clockwise as seen from the glass in this mount",
    "2026-09-07: Nollie 32 via OpenRGB exposes 32 zones at 0 LEDs; sized per zone (openrgb -d N -z Z -sz S), sizes kept in bridge.zone_sizes because OpenRGB profiles do not restore them",
    "2026-09-07: strimers through the bridge are one 20-LED (ATX) or 27-LED (GPU) zone per row; the 120-LED strimer templates cannot bind, so they are bridge_rows",
    "2026-09-07: ENE DRAM reads 8 LEDs per stick only when no native SMBus scan runs at the same time"
  ],
